<title>UK: BOE allots 3.358 bln stg on UK money market repos.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 3.358 bln stg on UK money market repos.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England allotted a total 3.358 billion stg in repurchase and secured loan facilities at 5-31/32 percent for the UK money market.</p>
<p>It is offering 1.899 billion stg on the repo due December 5, 6 and 9 and 1.459 billion stg in the repo due on December 19, 20 and 23.</p>
<p>The facilities open on Thursday, Friday and next Monday.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7708</p>
</text>
